@startuml StandardWeaponState
state "StandardWeaponState" as EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState {
  state "Attack" as EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Attack
  state "Idle" as EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Idle
}

EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Attack --> EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Idle : StartIdle
EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Idle --> EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Attack : StartAttack

EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Attack : OnEnter → Attacking
EternalJourney_Weapon_Standard_State_StandardWeaponState_Idle : OnEnter → Idling
@enduml